      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW CHRISTIE (2) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 5 lengths into third (25.76) at Shepparton in a Grade 5 over 450m. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Good form should continue. BUSH BIG SHOW (7) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (25.84) in a Free For All at this track. Solid record at the distance winning eight races. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. PADDY'S CHARIOT (5) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at this track over 390m behind Criminal Minds (22.51) in a Grade 5. Should be about the mark. LEKTRA ROSA (1) can sneak into the finish.",
